_inline_component_fields:"The `inline` mode requires a single Boolean, Color, DateTime, Number, Relation, Select or String field. A Relation or Select field can’t have the `multiple` option enabled.",invalid_regex:"The `{$option}` option contains an invalid regular expression `{$pattern}`, which is ignored.",invalid_reorder_group:"The `reorder` option refers to a view group named `{$name}`, but no such group is defined in the `view_groups` option.",invalid_bulk_edit_field:"The `fields` list of the `bulk_edit` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such top-level field is defined in the collection.",unsupported_bulk_edit_field:"The `{$name}` field in the `fields` list of the `bulk_edit` option can’t be edited in bulk. Only a Boolean, Color, DateTime, Number, Relation, Select or String field that isn’t read-only, doesn’t have the `multiple` option enabled and isn’t set automatically on save is supported.",invalid_sortable_field:"The `sortable_fields` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.",multiple_sortable_field_defaults:"Only one item in the `sortable_fields` option can have the `default_sort` option.",invalid_table_column_field:"The `{$option}` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.",invalid_view_group_field:"The `view_groups` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.",invalid_view_filter_field:"The `view_filters` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.",missing_view_group_name:"The view group {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.",invalid_view_group_name:"The view group name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters.",duplicate_view_group_name:"View group names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.",missing_view_filter_name:"The view filter {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.",invalid_view_filter_no_condition:"The view filter {$count} must have the `pattern` option or a comparison option such as `eq` or `gte` to match entries against.",invalid_view_filter_name:"The view filter name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters.",duplicate_view_filter_name:"View filter names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.",invalid_view_group_default:"The `default` option of `view_groups` is set to `{$name}`, but no view group has that name.",invalid_view_filter_default:"The `default` option of `view_filters` is set to `{$name}`, but no view filter has that name.",missing_collection_name:"The collection {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.",invalid_collection_name:"The collection name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters.",duplicate_collection_name:"Collection names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.",missing_collection_file_name:"The collection file {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.",invalid_collection_file_name:"The collection file name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters.",duplicate_collection_file_name:"Collection file names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.",collection_no_fields:"The collection must have the `fields` option defined with at least one field.",collection_file_no_fields:"The collection file must have the `fields` option defined with at least one field.",collection_folder_i18n_required:"The collection must have the `i18n` option defined if the `locale` placeholder is used in the `folder` path.",invalid_collection_folder_locale:"The `folder` path `{$folder}` is invalid. The `locale` placeholder must be used only once as a whole folder name, like `content/\\{\\{locale\\}\\}/posts`.",collection_file_i18n_required:"The collection file must have the `i18n` option defined if the `locale` placeholder is used in the `file` path.",collection_i18n_